<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="eyebrow">服务确认</view><text class="muted">确认服务完成后可提交评价。</text><view class="field">服务评价<picker range="{{ratings}}" bindchange="pickRating"><view class="picker">{{selectedRating}}</view></picker></view><view class="field">补充说明（可选）<textarea class="textarea" bindinput="setComment" placeholder="可填写服务体验或待改进的问题" /></view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit">确认完成并提交评价</button></view></view>
